OL,3,A'It's nice to see you,' Harry tells
OL,4,Acrowds as he and Meghan visit
OL,5,ANottingham charities
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are met
OL,8,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,9,Fas they tour Nottingham on their first
OL,10,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,11,Freturning to the UK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan have taken part in a
OL,14,Fcooking class at Himmah, a charity
OL,15,Ftackling food poverty. The Duchess was
OL,16,Falso reunited with her "ladies", who
OL,17,Fshe worked with on a cookbook in 2018
OL,19,FThe pair's first stop was the Community
OL,20,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,21,FHarry has a long relationship with
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
