OL,3,A'It's nice to see you,' Harry tells
OL,4,Acrowds as he and Meghan visit
OL,5,ANottingham charities
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmily Davis, 21, gave Meghan a bunch of
OL,8,Fyellow flowers. "I just said, 'I've
OL,9,Falways wanted to meet you'," she tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC, while Amanda Geary, 54, says
OL,11,Fshe's "been a fan of Harry ever since
OL,12,Fhe was born"
OL,14,FHarry and Meghan are in the city where
OL,15,Fthey made their first joint appearance
OL,16,Fafter announcing their engagement in
OL,17,F2017
